   <narrative xml:lang="SV">3 ILEIA, Centre for Information on Low External Input and Sustainable Agriculture (LEISA), &#xE4;r en holl&#xE4;ndsk enskild organisation som sammanst&#xE4;ller och publicerar och utbyter information om h&#xE5;llbara jordbrukstill&#xE4;mpningar som &#xE4;r relevanta f&#xF6;r sm&#xE5;brukare i syd och till organisationer som st&#xF6;djer dem. LEISA-tidskriften publiseras kvartalsvis.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILEIA, the Centre for Information on Low external Input and  Sustainable Agriculture (LEISA), is a Dutch NGO that collects, publishes and exchanges information on sustainable agricultural practices that are relevant for small scale farmers in the South and to organisations that support them. The LEISA Magazine is published quarterly.</narrative>
  </description>
